  "notes": [
    "mlb rows come from the statsapi feed/live REST endpoint on every tick; --mlb-live (docs/operations relaunch scripts) only attaches lineup facts and does not change the source",
    "bin(x) = floor(2x + 0.5) / 2 (0.5 s bins, half-up); quantiles are taken on the bin Counters",
    "per row publish + fetch equals the un-binned play lag, but medians are not additive",
    "age_all_live covers every live row with a source_ts (stale-feed tail) and is never mixed into fetch",
    "latency measurement of archived rows only; not a forecast and not a trading claim"
  ],
